    "detailed_description": "<strong>You move to a new Town...</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2022 A Combination of Life Sim Adventure, RPG and Management</strong></h2>Build up an old Hotel to bring joy to your future guest\u00b4s and bring back it\u00b4s past success. On your Break you can explore Odd Town, an modern town filled with residents to meet, story\u00b4s to experience and secret\u00b4s to uncover.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140470/extras/d247f837481b7a56063daf9969ae0851.poster.avif?t=1746908954\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140470/extras/d247f837481b7a56063daf9969ae0851.webm?t=1746908954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140470/extras/d247f837481b7a56063daf9969ae0851.mp4?t=1746908954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2022 Collecting, Customization and Management Gameplay</strong></h2>Collect new furniture and combine them to customize and improve the hotel guest room\u00b4s. Meet your guest\u00b4s expectations to earn money or try to gain happy point\u00b4s by starting your day with a vacuum cleaner to keep your hotel nice and tidy. Use your earning\u00b4s later to upgrade your hotel and tools.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140470/extras/20b1674e6862b30ce151836e9146ff9d.poster.avif?t=1746908954\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140470/extras/20b1674e6862b30ce151836e9146ff9d.webm?t=1746908954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140470/extras/20b1674e6862b30ce151836e9146ff9d.mp4?t=1746908954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2022 Live your Life and meet Characters with unique Story\u00b4s</strong></h2>Meet and befriend Odd Town\u00b4s resident\u00b4s, each one with their own handcrafted story and questline. Make little presents or help them in their daily life to get closer and learn more about them.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140470/extras/3b9238908dd985c2d8ec4112774d4fbe.poster.avif?t=1746908954\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140470/extras/3b9238908dd985c2d8ec4112774d4fbe.webm?t=1746908954\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140470/extras/3b9238908dd985c2d8ec4112774d4fbe.mp4?t=1746908954\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2022 Get distracted by the many activities in Odd Town</strong></h2>Next to building up your hotel you can easily get distracted by Odd Towns many activities like sidequest\u00b4s, the arcade, bug hunting, hotel gardening and much more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140470/extras/af3a3810c3310335d11e8d96b31d1b95.avif?t=1746908954\" /></div>",
